    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──真乃、今日は色々まわったけど\r\n疲れたりしてないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──あっ……は、はいっ\r\nあの……全然、平気です……っ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんも、\r\nいつも付き添っていただいてありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それこそ全然平気だ……！\r\n近くで活躍を見られるのがプロデューサーの特権だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだ真乃、今日の撮影最初のほうで\r\nセリフが台本と違うところあったけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ……えっと、あれは……\r\nす、すみません……勝手なことをしてしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ、いや、謝らせたかったわけじゃないんだ\r\n今までにもアドリブが必要なところたくさんあったんだし",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、台本からそれるのは初めてだと思って\r\nちょっと気になってな、すまん",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "い、いえ……私こそ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040090"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……その、せっかく出演させていただいているので\r\n私、もっと頑張らなきゃダメだって──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "0052",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "もっと気の利いたことを言えるように\r\nならないとって思ったんです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "…………でも、全然上手にはできなかったなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか、なるほどな",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……真乃が何かをできるようになりたいって\r\n思うことはいいことだと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん、でも、そうだな……確かに今日は\r\n少し肩に力が入り過ぎていたように見える",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あんまり気負わずに、撮影を楽しむくらいの気持ちで\r\nやってみるのもいいかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\n……次は……ちゃんと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040130"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ともあれ、今日はもうなんにも考えずに休んでくれ\r\nここのところ、毎日レッスンや撮影で慌ただしかったからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい……\r\n……でも、あの、プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あの……事務所に戻ったら、\r\nこのままレッスン場をお借りすることはできないでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……せめて、声を少しでも大きくしっかり出して\r\nお話できるように、練習したいんです……っ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うーん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……む、難しいでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃はずっと休みなしだったからな……\r\nできれば今日はゆっくり過ごしてほしいと思うよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……休める時にしっかり休息をとるのも\r\n真乃の大事な仕事だから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……っ\r\nそ、そうですよね……すみません",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや…………真乃は、失敗したなってことも\r\nそうやってちゃんと真剣に考えてくれるから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから焦らなくても大丈夫\r\n結果はきちんと次につながっていくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1001003040190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はい、プロデューサーさん\r\nありがとうございます……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100100304/1001003040190"
